**/node_modules
**/dist
.git
# google-github-actions/auth (deploy.yml) writes this into the workspace before both
# image builds. A single-stage Dockerfile's COPY . . would bake the deployer's WIF
# credential straight into a pulled image; gate-runner's is pulled by the gate, which
# runs hostile candidate code that could read and replay it as github-actions-deployer.
gha-creds-*.json
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/*.log
apps/web/dist
coverage
.husky
